.DS_Store

# Editor MCP config carries credentials inline, and it is the kind of file a
# `git add -A` picks up without anyone reading it. This repo tracks no
# `.vscode/` at all, and this keeps it that way.
#
# Push protection is enabled here and would not be enough on its own: it matches
# known vendors' formats, so an unrecognised one passes. "Scan for non-provider
# patterns" is the setting that covers those, and it cannot be toggled through
# the API. This entry is the control that does not depend on that.
.vscode/mcp.json
